cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ForMash3D in your research, game development, or visual effects pipelines, please cite it as below."
title: "ForMash3D: Open-Source, Self-Hosted Generative 3D Asset Creation Platform"
abstract: "ForMash3D is an open-source, self-hosted AI 3D asset generation studio serving as a private, GPU-accelerated alternative to cloud services like Tripo AI and Meshy. It unifies 23 neural shape, texture, and motion models with an automated game-ready post-processing pipeline featuring quad retopology, PBR texturing, multi-tier LODs, and physics colliders."
authors:
  - name: "ForMash3D Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Silentzx2/ForMash3D"
url: "https://github.com/Silentzx2/ForMash3D"
